{"id": "16-2515-2-2", "zh": "以 j 结尾的词根", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2516-2-4", "zh": "vajja，义为“避开”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2516-5-8", "zh": "vajjeti、vajjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2516-9-10", "zh": "parivajjanako（避开者）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2516-11-17", "zh": "“比丘啊，你被持戒的人们避开，要怎么办呢？”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2517-2-4", "zh": "tujja，义为“力量”与“守护”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2517-5-8", "zh": "tujjeti、tujjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2518-2-5", "zh": "tuji、piji，义为“伤害”“力量”“给予”“住处”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2518-6-8", "zh": "niketana 就是住所。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2518-9-12", "zh": "tuñjeti、tuñjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2518-13-14", "zh": "piñjeti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2518-15-16", "zh": "piñjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2519-2-4", "zh": "khaji，义为“艰难地生活”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2519-5-8", "zh": "khañjeti、khañjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2519-9-10", "zh": "khañjo（跛子）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2520-2-4", "zh": "khaji，义为“守护”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2520-5-7", "zh": "词形与上面相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2520-8-22", "zh": "在 bhū 等类动词中，“khaji，义为行走有缺陷”这个词根的形式是“khañjati”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2521-2-4", "zh": "pūja，义为“供养”。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2521-5-8", "zh": "pūjeti、pūjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2521-9-10", "zh": "pūjā（供养）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2521-11-14", "zh": "唯有这样的供养才更殊胜。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2521-15-26", "zh": "pūjako（供养者）、pūjito（受供养的）、pūjanīyo、pūjaneyyo、pūjetabbo（应受供养的）、pujjo（值得尊敬的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2522-2-5", "zh": "gaja，义为“践踏”与“发声”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2522-6-9", "zh": "gajeti、gajayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2522-10-11", "zh": "gajo（象）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2523-2-4", "zh": "tija，义为“磨利”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2523-5-8", "zh": "tejeti、tejayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2524-2-4", "zh": "vaja，义为“寻求”与“整治”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2524-5-8", "zh": "vajeti、vajayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2525-2-4", "zh": "tajja，义为“恐吓”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2525-5-8", "zh": "tajjeti、tajjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2525-9-12", "zh": "santajjeti、santajjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2525-13-14", "zh": "santajjito（受到恐吓的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2526-2-4", "zh": "ajja，义为“备办”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2526-5-8", "zh": "ajjeti、ajjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2527-2-4", "zh": "sajja，义为“准备”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2527-5-9", "zh": "sajjeti dānaṃ、sajjayati dānaṃ（准备布施）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2527-10-12", "zh": "准备好动身之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2528-2-4", "zh": "bhaja，义为“亲近信赖”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2528-5-8", "zh": "bhajeti、bhajayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2528-9-23", "zh": "而在 bhū 等类动词中，形式是“bhajati”，还有 bhatti（亲近、信敬）、sambhatti（亲密）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2529-2-7", "zh": "tuji、piji、luji、bhaji，义为“言说”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2529-8-11", "zh": "tuñjeti、tuñjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2529-12-15", "zh": "piñjeti、piñjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2529-16-19", "zh": "luñjeti、luñjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2529-20-23", "zh": "bhañjeti、bhañjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2529-24-26", "zh": "意思是“说”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2530-2-4", "zh": "ruja，义为“伤害”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2530-5-8", "zh": "rojeti、rojayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2530-9-10", "zh": "rogo（疾病）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2531-2-4", "zh": "bhāja，义为“分开”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2531-5-11", "zh": "puthakamma 就是使之分开，意思是分别处理。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2531-12-15", "zh": "bhājeti、bhājayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2531-16-19", "zh": "vibhājeti、vibhājayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2531-20-21", "zh": "vibhatti（区分）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2532-2-4", "zh": "sabhāja，义为“喜悦”与“亲近”。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2532-5-8", "zh": "sabhājeti、sabhājayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2533-2-4", "zh": "laja，义为“显示”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2533-5-8", "zh": "lajeti、lajayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2533-9-10", "zh": "lājā（炒米花）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2534-2-4", "zh": "yuja，义为“约束”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2534-5-8", "zh": "加前缀 saṃ 时，义为“束缚”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2534-9-12", "zh": "yojeti、yojayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2534-13-16", "zh": "saṃyojeti、saṃyojayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2534-17-18", "zh": "saṃyojanaṃ（结缚）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2535-2-4", "zh": "majja，义为“清洁”与“装饰”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2535-5-8", "zh": "majjeti、majjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2535-9-12", "zh": "sammajjeti、sammajjayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2535-13-14", "zh": "sammajjā（打扫）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2536-2-5", "zh": "bhāja，义为“分配”与“给予”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2536-6-9", "zh": "bhājeti、bhājayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2536-10-17", "zh": "“珊阇耶啊，你的儿子毗输安呾啰怎么能把大象送给别人？”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2537-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 j 结尾的词根的各种形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2538-2-5", "zh": "以 jh、ñ 结尾的词根很少见。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2538-6-27", "zh": "在梵语文法书中，人们读作“ñā，义为差遣”，但它的形式与佛语不相符合，所以我们没有列出。", "confidence": 70}
